exports[`recipes convert to vegan > 02-website-cookies.txt > matches the saved vegan version 1`] = `
"Chewy Chocolate Chip Cookies
Ingredients
1 cup unsalted vegan butter, softened
1 cup packed brown sugar
1/2 cup granulated sugar
2 flax eggs (2 tbsp ground flaxseed + 6 tbsp water, rested 5 min)
2 teaspoons vanilla extract
3 cups all-purpose flour
1 teaspoon baking soda
2 cups semi-sweet chocolate chips
Instructions
Cream the vegan butter and sugars together until fluffy.
Beat in the flax eggs one at a time, then the vanilla.
Stir in the flour and baking soda, then fold in the chocolate chips.
Bake at 350°F for 10 to 12 minutes."
`;

